{"id":"2837c20d21b63513","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-order10-convex-subset.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Convex Subset","display":"df-zfc-order10-convex-subset — ZFC Order10 Convex Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-convex-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-convex-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-convex-subset — ZFC Order10 Convex Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-convex-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-convex-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-convex-subset — ZFC Order10 Convex Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,C\\in V,\\quad C\\subseteq P\">\\(P,\\leq_P,C\\in V,\\quad C\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}convex\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,z\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\land y\\leq_P z\\to y\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}convex\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,z\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\land y\\leq_P z\\to y\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is order convexity, not vector-space convexity; the designated partial order is therefore explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,C\\in V,\\quad C\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}convex\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10ConvexSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall x,z\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\land y\\leq_P z\\to y\\in C)","display":true}],"bytes":892,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2857"